Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twentieth Episode\NThe Shadow Eaters
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.58,0:02:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you like listening\Nto music, eh, little sheep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Let's go for a walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go for a walk!\N- Hey, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I know where you are going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Tink! We are\Ngoing to listen to a legend...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.94,0:02:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...from an old inhabitant of the\Nforest! Why don't you come too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how wonderful!\NI like legends so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, what a blow!\NI really hurt myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I play the flute, but\Ndon't look at me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I will play\Nsomething sweeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of story would\Nyou like to hear today, children?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to hear\Na story about pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, pirates are not\Ninteresting anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I, instead, would like to\Nhear the story of a Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am! Wait!\NLet me listen too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My boy, there was no need for\Nyou to rush over with such haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must continue\Nto watch the sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.46,0:03:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,After listening to the\Nstory, I am forced to run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I took a little time off to\Nbe able to hear your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it is right\Nto take this liberty...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...while you watch the flock?\N- But it's only for a short time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, since it seems everyone\Nhas arrived, I can begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, come on, begin!\N- Good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I will tell you the\Nstory of the shadow eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.30,0:03:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shadow eaters?!\N- That's right, my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.74,0:04:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be surprised,\Nnow, by this term.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, later, you\Nwill understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then. You must know\Nthat once upon a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,when there were few living\Ncreatures on Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,it was natural that they could not\Neasily find each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,As a consequence, it happened\Nthat all living creatures...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...felt lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,None of them had friends\Nand many cried all day long,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so they were all depressed\Nand almost always sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Lord\Nbegan to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...and thought that if he\Nprovided them with friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,they would return\Nto good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That was how the Lord\Ncreated shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But one day the shadows disappeared...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...and men plunged back\Ninto depression.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the Lord,\Nthinking it over and over,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,found the solution once again...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...and attached the shadows\Nto the feet of men,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,so they could no longer\Nbe stolen...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.58,0:04:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...and finally they could have\Nfriends forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.14,0:05:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then, shadows became\Npeople's best friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but since then they also aroused the\Nappetites of the shadow eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! Those sheep\Nhave wandered away from the flock!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What a hassle...! I have to\Ngo and get those two back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's something in\Nthe lake! What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It ate the sheep's shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be\Nthe shadow eater!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.66,0:06:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It might come towards us!\NYou'd better run away, children!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Help!\N- Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.34,0:06:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it has seen us, guys!\NWe'd better run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, run faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's a house!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.30,0:07:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me carefully: let's not be\Nheard! Stay quiet and still!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, the monsters are\Napproaching the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, Tink, bar the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.02,0:07:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink, we must also bar\Nthe windows! - Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That window was left unbarred!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, the roof is collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous here! We must get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:07:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to stop it! You get out\Nwhile I am fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned shadow eater,\NI do not fear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell into a hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!\NI fell into an old well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Mom! Help!\N- Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on down there?\NLet's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come, we must escape!\N- The monster took my shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.62,0:08:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Let's escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.90,0:08:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's run! Let's run!\N- Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Damn it!\NIt ate my shadow too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Those monsters are interesting:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the male eats\Nthe boys' shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the female eats the girls'!\NI'll show them Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's already here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:08:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But where is my horse's head?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No, please!\NMine is a cheap shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's indigestible, can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way! Make way! Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, are you okay?\NHey, is there no one up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, can you hear\Nme? Is anyone up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here! Thank\Nheaven! You're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.10,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought something had\Nhappened to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm relieved.\NThank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.86,0:09:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you,\NI don't know what I would have done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? What's going on now?\NWhy all this crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, what on earth happened to you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The monsters ate\Nour shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.06,0:09:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!\NSo they succeeded
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.14,0:10:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow-eating monster...\NLet's see here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is, I found it!\NIt's him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, it's really him.\N- His name is Kagera...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...and he loves to eat the shadows\Nof humans and animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Originally, it seems he was a giant\Nsnail that lived in lakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen to the children whose\Nshadows were eaten by the monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,400 years ago,\Nthe same thing happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and it says here that those children\Ndied the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They died?! Doctor, doesn't it say there\Nif there's a way to save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There is, but it's very difficult!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take all the children of this\Ncity to safety underground!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The monsters won't get them! I must\Nsucceed in saving these children!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.74,0:10:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!\NThe monsters are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.02,0:10:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- They are heading towards the city!\N- I don't have much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The male monsters\Neat the boys' shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the female ones\Neat those of the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster that will want\NSapphire's shadow, what will it be like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, there's a female too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.42,0:11:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot! If they don't die,\Nthey will destroy the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We must try\Nto get them away from the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, but how?\N- I will act as bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will get the monsters to follow me\Nup the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way\Nto drive them away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Prince, can I come with you?\N- All right, come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be interesting to see which\Nmonster is attracted by your shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- What? Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The male monster\Ncraves the shadows of boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the female, instead,\Nthose of girls
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:12:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We will see how they behave\Nin front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.42,0:12:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, monsters!\NTry to take my shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.38,0:12:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting! The male monster\Ndoesn't seem interested in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you to the\Nmountain! You'll be safe there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster is chasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, don't run\Ntowards the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.90,0:13:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Kagera will go to the castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.22,0:13:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kagera!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your enemy! Come\Non, take my shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This time Prince\NSapphire won't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, kill him! Good\Nmonster! Try to catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.06,0:13:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that! Yes, yes, good! Eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will help Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.10,0:14:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, Tink!\NRaise the drawbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.22,0:14:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Tink, recover
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone go take shelter\Nin the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I will manage to destroy the monsters\Nand return your shadows to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My head! It's so heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never seen\Nsomething so heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My pinky!\NIt grabbed my pinky!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.06,0:14:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the female\Nthat was hunting Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just as I thought!\N- There is a child in the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.06,0:14:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do we care about that child?\N- But he is your son!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.86,0:14:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My son! It's really my son!\NIt's Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, someone run\Nto help my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My shadow!\NLeave my shadow alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's gone! What do I do,\Nnow, without my shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster has eaten\NPlastic's shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.82,0:15:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Plastic! Don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the monsters are sleeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My son! My son!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you, my son?\NAre you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.02,0:15:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:15:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my son's shadow\Nhas been eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where are the monsters?\N- They are sleeping in the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! The sun is setting\Nand the shadow does not appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.18,0:16:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so they are resting.\NGood, now is the right time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, hello, Prince!\N- Doctor, have you found...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...the way to get the shadow back?\N- Yes, I have found it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but this doesn't seem like a good\Nmethod. In fact, it's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.90,0:16:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We must use it anyway.\NTell me, what is it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The book says that\Nif we destroy the two monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,the shadows will return immediately,\Nbut, unfortunately, the only one...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...who can succeed\Nin destroying them is the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- The devil?!\N- Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The book says that\Nif we offer him as a sacrifice..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...what he desires most,\Nhe will destroy the monsters...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...and will return all the shadows\Nto their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What can the devil desire\Nabove all else?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto, Prince of Darkness,\Nlisten to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to speak to you!\NCome out! I am Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer! Sapphire wants to speak to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the light of the torch\Nand I will listen to what you have to tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And so you must ask me\Nfor a favor, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask for anything you desire!\NMephisto can do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Heaven were to burn\Nand the Earth were destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we devils will never die, as\Nlong as a tiny flame exists!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me what you desire\Nand I will tell you my conditions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.94,0:17:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You must destroy the\Nshadow-eating monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kagera? Even Sapphire seems\Nfrightened by that monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it is very easy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:18:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But in exchange for\Nmy help, I want to have...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know what you want!\NAll right, I will give it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You will have my boy's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you are a\NPrince truly very generous!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, destroy Kagera and bring me\NSapphire's male heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of finding out\Nif Sapphire is a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you attracted the monsters...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,..and they broke my son's\Nlittle toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the sun is about to rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,With the sun,\Nthe monsters will wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron, Nylon, you are nothing but\Na useless idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, Yes! Yes! Yes!\N- Grand Duke, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.90,0:18:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are safe,\Nbecause there is no shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the water there is no\Nshadow, therefore they cannot eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, help me get\NKagera out of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.58,0:19:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stupid Kagera! Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.14,0:19:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It heard us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me! Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.34,0:19:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- First, get off your horse!\N- Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the elixir that makes\Nthe shadow stick to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's leave quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.74,0:19:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's surprising how my\Nshadow is sticking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In a little while, it will get\Ninteresting. Look! Water for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:20:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Down!\NNow, sugar for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pour it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.50,0:20:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you want to do?\N- You will know soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a spoon!\NStir the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you intend to\Ndo with the sugar water?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This seems to me\Na strange spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A broom for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Apply the sugar water with\Nthis to the shadow of Kagera!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what use it\Ncan be, this sugar water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.22,0:20:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There, Hecate!\NI did as you ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, they have begun to\Neat the shadow. Water, rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.02,0:21:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now pay attention. You'll\Nsee how I will destroy them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They are eating\Ntheir own shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon that sugar water\Nwill become salt water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.22,0:21:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Kagera is nothing but a\Nhuge snail, it will melt with the salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.94,0:21:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray, we are saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.82,0:22:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow is back! Hooray!\NHooray! How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow has returned! Thank\Ngoodness! You are safe, my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic, you are safe! You\Nare safe! How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray! Plastic\Nis safe! Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.46,0:22:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray!\NThe shadow is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.54,0:22:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Hecate, as promised,\Nyou can even take my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.\NA tree for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.26,0:22:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, mount this one\Nand come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.26,0:22:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the devil! Sapphire\Nhas been taken by the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't wait\Nfor this day to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire, are you ready?\N- No, Mephisto! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.42,0:22:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that angel!\NStay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to take the heart of\NSapphire, you will have to fight us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I destroyed Kagera\Nand the deal was...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...that I could take\NSapphire's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.90,0:23:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you my heart instead of\Nhers, and I will give it to you now! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.02,0:23:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!\NMy body is paralyzed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.90,0:23:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, run! Cheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I am glad that you kept\Nyour boy's heart, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.98,0:23:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We are both safe now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.58,0:23:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful Hecate is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, friend! See you! Goodbye!
